# The image (deploy/Dockerfile) is built from these and nothing else: everything
# is left out, then what the build reads is let back in. A list of what to keep
# rather than of what to leave out, so that nothing new in the repository — a
# .env file, a folder of rooms, a local build — reaches the build context, let
# alone the image, without somebody deciding it should.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!index.html
!vite.config.js
!src/
!public/
!scripts/
!engine/
!deploy/
